      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Cinematic high-fashion editorial video in an empty grand ballroom late at night, crystal chandeliers dimmed low, gilded mirrors, honey-toned parquet stretching away. The three models stand together mid-floor in a relaxed cluster, unhurried and regal. Centre: Em1l1_05, a light-brown-skinned female model with dark curly hair, large silver hoop earrings and the Nocturne Relic Necklace with amber pendant, in a black blazer over a sheer black mesh top with embroidered swirls. Left: M4le_M0del_01, a dark-skinned male model with short braids, in a long black overcoat over a dark grey ribbed turtleneck and a fine silver curb-link chain with a triangle pendant, black leather handbag at his side. Right, a clear head taller: Berl1n_Model_v01, a pale-skinned platinum-buzzcut female with sharp eyeliner and small ear piercings, in a glossy black leather trench over a white t-shirt. Slow crane up and back, the vast ballroom and chandeliers opening around them. Direct-flash realism, three stable identities, hyper-detailed textures, cinematic interior grade, no dialogue. Instareal, l3n0v0"
      ],
      "color": "#d4d4d4",
      "bgcolor": "#c0c0c0",
